    <string name="rules_how_to">How to play</string>
    <string name="rule_1">Drag your finger — the sphere smoothly follows it.</string>
    <string name="rule_2">Dodge asteroids: a collision costs one life.</string>
    <string name="rule_3">Collect stars for points and a higher score multiplier.</string>
    <string name="rule_4">Combo grows from close fly-bys and gives bonus points.</string>
    <string name="rule_5">A heart restores a life, a shield absorbs one hit.</string>
    <string name="rule_6">Pause is the button in the top-right corner.</string>
    <string name="rule_7">After 90 seconds asteroids gradually speed up and spawn more often.</string>
    <string name="rules_multiplier">Score multiplier</string>
    <string name="rules_multiplier_desc">Stars raise the score multiplier according to the Workshop level. Close fly-bys build a separate multiplier, the boss grants a third x2 after four zones, and a shield preserves multipliers after a hit.</string>
    <string name="rules_progress">Progress</string>
    <string name="rule_progress_1">Neon is the sum of Classic/Hardcore/Daily Challenge run scores plus 300 per completed quest. Zen is training and gives no neon for score.</string>
    <string name="rule_progress_2">Every day the game offers three new quests out of seven. The Daily Challenge gives one attempt, a fixed seed and a separate record.</string>
    <string name="rule_progress_3">Sphere and trail skins unlock through records, combos and dodges.</string>
